    both pins move to 2.6.0 together. melband-roformer-infer==0.1.5 only
    requires torch>=2.0, so 2.6.0 is compatible; no source/CLI code
    changes needed. See README.debian.md ("PyTorch / CUDA compatibility
    used for build pinning") for detail.

